# EqualWeb

> EqualWeb is a next-generation digital accessibility platform, combining AI-powered remediation, certified IAAP/CPWA experts, continuous monitoring, and managed compliance to help organizations build, maintain, and prove accessibility at scale.

EqualWeb (EqualWeb Ltd.) is a Hybrid Accessibility Platform founded in 2014. Markets: United States, Canada, United Kingdom, European Union, Israel, Australia. Certifications: IAAP CPACC/CPWA certified experts, ISO/IEC 27001:2022, GDPR, CCPA.

