- [WCAG 2.2: The 9 New Criteria and How to Comply](https://www.equalweb.com/wcag/2-2/): WCAG 2.2 is the current accessibility standard: 86 success criteria, 9 new since 2.1, one removed. What changed, who must comply, and how to get there.
